1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,580
I've done hours in those chairs, and I've done nights in those beds

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:06,500
Where the machines keep beeping till you hear them in your head

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,180
Where the clock forgets to move, and the lights stay on all night

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:13,940
And the stranger in the next chair is putting up a fight

5
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:17,780
The nurses did the best they could at a job I couldn't do

6
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:21,000
Watching people slowly fade and never shift the whole way through
